+> STOP. Captain's notes: non-binding. Captain writes, Captain trims. Anyone else: close this file now.
+
+# Captain Notes
+
+## State
+- Greenfield bootstrap complete. RIGGING.md authored with minimal methods.
+- 4 feature files written (42 scenarios total): todos, editing, routing, persistence.
+- watchbill.json lists all 42 scenarios in watch1.
+- No production code exists yet. js/ and css/ directories scaffolded and empty.
+
+## Decisions
+- App name for localStorage key: `todos-javascript` (per spec: `todos-[framework]`).
+- No tier tags assigned — all scenarios are default-tier @logic-equivalent (untagged).
+- No preprocessors; vanilla JS as specified.
+- Framework used: none (vanilla JS), so localStorage key is `todos-javascript`.
+- CSS: use template as-is, app.css for overrides if needed.
+- Routing: native hashchange via window.location.hash. No Director library needed.
