diff --git a/features/editing.feature b/features/editing.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d0c982b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/editing.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,67 @@
+Feature: Todo editing
+  As a user
+  I want to edit existing todos
+  So that I can correct or update their titles
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: Activating edit mode
+
+  Scenario: Double-clicking the label activates editing mode
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click the label of the "Buy milk" item
+    Then the "Buy milk" item should have the editing class
+    And the edit input should contain "Buy milk"
+    And the edit input should be focused
+
+  Scenario: Editing mode hides other controls
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click the label of the "Buy milk" item
+    Then the toggle checkbox should be hidden
+    And the label should be hidden
+    And the destroy button should be hidden
+
+  Rule: Saving edits
+
+  Scenario: Saves the edit when Enter is pressed
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    And I am editing the "Buy milk" item
+    When I change the edit input to "Buy organic milk" and press Enter
+    Then the "Buy organic milk" item should be in the todo list
+    And the "Buy milk" item should not be in the todo list
+    And the "Buy organic milk" item should not have the editing class
+
+  Scenario: Saves the edit when the input loses focus
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    And I am editing the "Buy milk" item
+    When I change the edit input to "Buy organic milk" and the input loses focus
+    Then the "Buy organic milk" item should be in the todo list
+    And the "Buy milk" item should not be in the todo list
+    And the "Buy organic milk" item should not have the editing class
+
+  Scenario: Trims the edited title
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    And I am editing the "Buy milk" item
+    When I change the edit input to "  Buy organic milk  " and press Enter
+    Then the "Buy organic milk" item should be in the todo list
+    And the "Buy milk" item should not be in the todo list
+
+  Rule: Deleting on empty edit
+
+  Scenario: Destroys the todo when the edit results in an empty title
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    And I am editing the "Buy milk" item
+    When I change the edit input to "  " and press Enter
+    Then the todo list should be empty
+
+  Rule: Cancelling edits
+
+  Scenario: Cancels editing when Escape is pressed
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    And I am editing the "Buy milk" item
+    When I change the edit input to "Changed title"
+    And I press the Escape key
+    Then the "Buy milk" item should not have the editing class
+    And the "Buy milk" item should still be labelled "Buy milk"
+    And the edit input value should not have been saved
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/features/persistence.feature b/features/persistence.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..83f77ff
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/persistence.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,71 @@
+Feature: Persistence
+  As a user
+  I want my todos to be saved between page loads
+  So that I do not lose my task list
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: Saving to localStorage
+
+  Scenario: Persists a new todo to localStorage
+    When I type "Buy milk" in the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then localStorage should have a record for the "todos-javascript" key
+    And the localStorage record should contain a todo with title "Buy milk"
+    And that todo should not be completed
+
+  Scenario: Persists a completed todo to localStorage
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on the "Buy milk" item
+    Then the localStorage record should contain a todo with title "Buy milk"
+    And that todo should be completed
+
+  Scenario: Persists a deleted todo removal to localStorage
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    When I click the destroy button on the "Buy milk" item
+    Then the localStorage record should not contain a todo with title "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Persists an edited todo to localStorage
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    And I am editing the "Buy milk" item
+    When I change the edit input to "Buy organic milk" and press Enter
+    Then the localStorage record should contain a todo with title "Buy organic milk"
+    And the localStorage record should not contain a todo with title "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Persists cleared completed todos to localStorage
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Write code"
+    And "Buy milk" is completed
+    And "Write code" is completed
+    When I click the clear-completed button
+    Then the localStorage record should contain a todo with title "Walk dog"
+    And the localStorage record should not contain a todo with title "Buy milk"
+    And the localStorage record should not contain a todo with title "Write code"
+
+  Rule: Restoring from localStorage
+
+  Scenario: Restores todos from localStorage on page load
+    Given localStorage contains a todo with title "Buy milk"
+    And localStorage contains a completed todo with title "Walk dog"
+    When I reload the app
+    Then the todo list should contain 2 items
+    And the "Walk dog" item should have the completed class
+    And the count should show "1"
+
+  Rule: Data format
+
+  Scenario: Uses the correct localStorage key format
+    When I type "Buy milk" in the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then the localStorage key should be "todos-javascript"
+
+  Scenario: Each todo has id, title, and completed fields
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    Then the localStorage record should contain a todo with an id property
+    And the localStorage record should contain a todo with a title property
+    And the localStorage record should contain a todo with a completed property
+
+  Rule: Editing state is not persisted
+
+  Scenario: Does not persist editing state
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    And I am editing the "Buy milk" item
+    Then the localStorage record should not contain any editing state
\ No newline at end of file
