@@ -0,0 +1,70 @@
+Feature: Routing and filtering
+  As a user
+  I want to filter my todos by completion state
+  So that I can focus on active or completed items
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+    And the todo list contains "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Write code"
+    And "Walk dog" is completed
+
+  Rule: Default route
+
+  Scenario: Shows all todos by default at the root route
+    Given the current route is "#/"
+    Then the todo list should contain 3 items
+    And the All filter link should have the selected class
+
+  Rule: Active filter
+
+  Scenario: Filters to active todos
+    Given I navigate to "#/active"
+    Then the todo list should contain 2 items
+    And the todo list should contain "Buy milk"
+    And the todo list should contain "Write code"
+    And the todo list should not contain "Walk dog"
+    And the Active filter link should have the selected class
+
+  Rule: Completed filter
+
+  Scenario: Filters to completed todos
+    Given I navigate to "#/completed"
+    Then the todo list should contain 1 item
+    And the todo list should contain "Walk dog"
+    And the todo list should not contain "Buy milk"
+    And the todo list should not contain "Write code"
+    And the Completed filter link should have the selected class
+
+  Rule: Filter link selection
+
+  Scenario: Toggles the selected class on filter links
+    Given the All filter link has the selected class
+    When I navigate to "#/active"
+    Then the All filter link should not have the selected class
+    And the Active filter link should have the selected class
+    When I navigate to "#/completed"
+    Then the Active filter link should not have the selected class
+    And the Completed filter link should have the selected class
+    When I navigate to "#/"
+    Then the Completed filter link should not have the selected class
+    And the All filter link should have the selected class
+
+  Rule: Filtered state updates
+
+  Scenario: Todo hidden from active filter when marked completed
+    Given I navigate to "#/active"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on the "Buy milk" item
+    Then the todo list should contain 1 item
+    And the todo list should contain "Write code"
+    And the todo list should not contain "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Todo hidden from completed filter when marked active
+    Given I navigate to "#/completed"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on the "Walk dog" item
+    Then the todo list should be empty
+
+  Scenario: Todo appears in active filter when uncompleted from completed view
+    Given I navigate to "#/completed"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on the "Walk dog" item
+    And I navigate to "#/active"
+    Then the todo list should contain 3 items
