diff --git a/features/todos.feature b/features/todos.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..01042bc
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todos.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,124 @@
+Feature: Todo management
+  As a user
+  I want to manage my todos
+  So that I can keep track of things I need to do
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: Empty state
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+    Given there are no todos
+    Then the main section should not be visible
+    And the footer should not be visible
+
+  Rule: Creating todos
+
+  Scenario: Create a new todo by pressing Enter
+    When I type "Buy milk" in the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then the todo list should contain 1 item
+    And the new item should be labelled "Buy milk"
+    And the new-todo input should be cleared
+
+  Scenario: Trims whitespace from the todo title
+    When I type "  Walk the dog  " in the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then the todo list should contain 1 item
+    And the new item should be labelled "Walk the dog"
+
+  Scenario: Does not create a todo for empty input
+    When I type "   " in the new-todo input and press Enter
+    Then the todo list should be empty
+
+  Rule: Completing todos
+
+  Scenario: Mark a todo as completed
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on the "Buy milk" item
+    Then the "Buy milk" item should have the completed class
+    And the todo should be marked as completed
+
+  Scenario: Toggle a completed todo back to active
+    Given the todo list contains a completed todo "Buy milk"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on the "Buy milk" item
+    Then the "Buy milk" item should not have the completed class
+
+  Rule: Deleting todos
+
+  Scenario: Delete a single todo
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    When I click the destroy button on the "Buy milk" item
+    Then the todo list should be empty
+
+  Scenario: Delete a specific todo from a list of several
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Write code"
+    When I click the destroy button on the "Walk dog" item
+    Then the todo list should contain 2 items
+    And the todo list should contain "Buy milk"
+    And the todo list should contain "Write code"
+    And the todo list should not contain "Walk dog"
+
+  Rule: Mark all as complete
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all todos to completed
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Write code"
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos should be marked as completed
+    And the toggle-all checkbox should be checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle all todos back to active
+    Given all todos are completed
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos should be active
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all checkbox state updates when individual items are checked
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Write code"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on "Buy milk"
+    And I click the toggle checkbox on "Walk dog"
+    And I click the toggle checkbox on "Write code"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox should be checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all checkbox is unchecked when not all items are complete
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Write code"
+    And I click the toggle checkbox on "Buy milk"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox on "Walk dog"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox should not be checked
+
+  Rule: Clear completed
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes all completed todos
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Write code"
+    And "Buy milk" is completed
+    And "Write code" is completed
+    When I click the clear-completed button
+    Then the todo list should contain 1 item
+    And the todo list should contain "Walk dog"
+    And the todo list should not contain "Buy milk"
+    And the todo list should not contain "Write code"
+
+  Scenario: Clear-completed button is hidden when there are no completed todos
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk", "Walk dog"
+    Then the clear-completed button should not be visible
+
+  Rule: Active todo counter
+
+  Scenario: Shows the count of active todos
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Write code"
+    And "Buy milk" is completed
+    Then the todo count should show "2"
+
+  Scenario: Pluralizes the item label for zero items
+    Given there are no todos
+    Then the todo count should say "0 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Pluralizes the item label for one item
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo count should say "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Pluralizes the item label for multiple items
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk", "Walk dog"
+    Then the todo count should say "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: The count number is wrapped in a strong element
+    Given the todo list contains "Buy milk", "Walk dog"
+    Then the count number should be inside a strong element
